ellpadding=\"5\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"500\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"194\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://www.forg.co.kr:80/Diablo/images/item/unique/u_main.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"420\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing.svg\" width=\"210\"></p>\n</td>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"306\"> <p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#908858\" face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><span>■ 유니크아이템은 모든 아이템보다도 월등한 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;능력을 \n                            지닌 아이템으로</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#908858\" face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;특히 </span></font><font color=\"#996600\" face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\">엘리트 유니크</font><font color=\"#908858\" face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><span>로된 </span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#908858\" face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;무기나방호구의 아이템은</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#908858\" face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;헌터들의 최상 목표이기도 합니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#908858\" face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><span>■ 디아블로의 특성상 99의 한정된 레벨보다는 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;아이템의 효과가 극대화되기 \n                            때문에 </span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#908858\" face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;위의 유니크아이템을</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#908858\" face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;모으는 것을 목표로 삼는 </span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#908858\" face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;플레이어들이 많습니다.</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td height=\"20\" width=\"627\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;<img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://www.forg.co.kr:80/Diablo/images/left_menu/b_logo.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"15\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing.svg\" width=\"100\">&nbsp;</font></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n",
